// Here the structure pattern repeats after 2 cycles,
// so certain haps from the melody are skipped.
"<0 1 2 3>".isobite("x x*2".slow(2)).n().scale("c:major")
// the same as "<[0] [2 3] [2] [2 3]>".n().scale("c:major")
